In the figure, $m\angle A = 28^{\circ}$, $m\angle B = 74^\circ$ and $m\angle C = 26^{\circ}$. If $x$ and $y$ are the measures of the angles in which they are shown, what is the value of $x + y$?

[asy]
size(150);
draw((0,5)--(0,0)--(15,0)--(15,5),linewidth(1));
draw((0,5)--(2,2)--(5,5)--(12,-2)--(15,5),linewidth(.7));
